WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.960
THE KNIGHT OF THE ENDRA

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.720
The shine, the feel...

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.930
This is real gold!

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.640
Chief, there's a letter with it.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:04.510
Chief!

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:06.140
All right!

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:13.070
That Axis cruiser wants us
to let it dock here.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.110
We can't very well refuse
after accepting this, can we?

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:21.320
Chief, there's an AEUG
ship in the port!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.450
This is why you'll
never get promoted!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.040
Try to be a little
more flexible!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:33.130
Two ships in port aren't going to
start shooting at each other, right?

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.340
But, sir!

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.760
An Axis cruiser is docking?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.760
Our main engines are repaired, aren't they?

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.850
What will you do?

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:44.640
Understood.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.060
Captain Bright!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.770
Mr. Chimatter.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.270
We don't have any extra money
to pay for your information.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.440
That's not why
I'm telling you!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.440
Look, it's just...
I like the Argama!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.610
Thank you.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.450
Captain! Emergency
communication from Torres!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.320
What is it?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.740
An Axis vessel is preparing
to enter Shangri-La!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.830
What do we do?!

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.700
The space port blocks
may be separate,

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.790
but they'll soon
find us if we stay here.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.250
Then let's escape into the colony!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.000
Yeah! There's an old passage...

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.720
we used to bring in raw materials
that leads into the colony.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.340
I can use an official tug
to tow you in, if you like.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:24.550
Really?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.680
Please leave this to me,
Captain Bright!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.970
Thank you.
I'll accept your offer.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.140
I'll arrange it immediately!

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:47.450
Captain Bright, we'll now
begin towing the Argama.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.540
I'll leave it to you, Mr. Chimatter.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.830
- Do it!
- Roger.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.340
Steer it off, already!
We scratch any more!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.930
Sorry, sir.
The balancer's malfunctioning.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:22.030
Did you see a warship
heading into the colony?

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.950
The AEUG?! No, it couldn't be.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.070
I was sent to ensure
the people of Colony 1,

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:32.290
I mean, of Shangri-La,
will obey Lady Haman.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:39.040
Whether the AEUG are lurking here or not,
I am determined to fight!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.720
Wait up!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.340
What's wrong?
The gravity's weaker here.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.010
You can't seriously expect us
to get up to the port on foot!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.060
Even the Argama
has to sleep at night.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.720
We can sneak aboard then.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.730
It's not like we can
use the elevator!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.730
Judau can work the Zeta.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.730
And then we can sell the
Zeta Gundam for a fortune!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.730
Just leave this to me!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.150
Big Brother!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.030
Leina!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.580
Elle, why'd you bring Leina?!

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.620
Just because.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.620
You let her bribe you?!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.540
Listen, you guys! Quit trying
to turn my brother into a criminal!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.500
What's that supposed
to mean, you--

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.800
Leina, you're making me mad!
We're working here!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.130
Stealing from people is work?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.600
You've got us all wrong!
The Argama's mobile suits can do heavy lifting.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.600
If we borrow them,
we can do bigger jobs!

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.730
I wasn't asking you, Iino!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:42.070
Leina, salvage is the only
honest work we can get!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.780
You can wash dishes or babysit
or some other job like that!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.360
What if I worked, too?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.240
You should just go
to school and study!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.120
I won't have you
turn out like me.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:57.080
So, you do understand that a kid
shouldn't be doing what you're doing.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.040
Isn't sibling love beautiful?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.420
Totally.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.420
Little sister!

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.630
Big brother!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.060
Hey!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.930
That's...!

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.320
Great, after I had to drag
that petit mobile suit up here.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:35.160
I was the one who rented it!
And it wasn't cheap, either!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.330
I know!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.380
Warn me
before you move!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.460
Big Brother, stop it!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.230
Big Brother!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.150
Now what?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.020
Well... We go after them!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.730
Attaboy!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.970
Its elegance and refinement
are not lost within its strength.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.680
A fine mobile suit.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.270
Just like this rose.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.360
My subordinates are still young.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.990
My lady.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:55.700
They are inexperienced in battle,
and unfamiliar with the Earth Sphere itself.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:56.870
Yes, my lady.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.580
But among them,
you have done very well.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.580
My lady!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.880
I... I'm not yet worthy of such...

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.090
You are a true knight.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.260
I want you to strive,
for my sake.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.470
Lady Haman!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.900
That rose is
really long-lasting, isn't it?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.900
I had it coated!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.900
If I can capture the Argama undamaged
and present it to Lady Haman,

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.910
she will surely
grant me her smile.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.490
Master Mashymre!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:43.750
This is my first campaign!
I will personally sortie in the Galluss-J!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.420
A commander should stay to the rear
and just lead confidently!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.380
We should launch the Gaza-C team!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.590
You think I can wait for them?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.880
Master Mashymre?

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.670
I'm launching. Stand aside!

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.260
What?
But we're still servicing it!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.680
It just has to move.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.810
My skills will make up
for anything else.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:05.440
Just wait 30 minutes, please!
At least let us put the hatch on!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.810
I don't need it!
I like a well-ventilated cockpit!

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.620
Galluss-J, heading out!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.580
I like this wind!
It soothes my burning blood!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.060
At least I was able to help
the Argama this much.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.100
Hm? Mr. Chimatter, there's something
hanging off of the Argama!

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.480
What?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.780
Okay, this'll work.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.280
Captain, Mr. Chimatter
reports that...

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.160
a petite mobile suit has
attached itself to the ship.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.280
Check it out!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.450
Hold it!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.870
Magnify the left-hand corner.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.170
Aye, sir!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.380
The kid from earlier today.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.090
Why, that...

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:14.960
Wait!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.090
Sir?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.880
Hold off for a while.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.800
He can't do anything
by himself. Besides...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.010
I have a feeling
about that kid.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:08.560
Since when do we have
to be on kitchen duty?

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.270
Quit complaining!
They're short-handed!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.350
But we'll never become pilots...

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:16.980
if we don't get to use
the mobile suit simulators!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.900
Shinta!
Work harder! Shinta!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.620
Shinta angry! Shinta angry!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.780
You've had a real
attitude lately! Get lost!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:33.290
Intruder alert! Intruder alert!
Intruder alert! Intruder alert!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:35.500
Crap!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:36.090
Hey!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.750
I'm gonna grab a snack.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.760
Hey, anything to eat?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.760
Nothing.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.260
You got your 4th meal,
didn't you?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.760
We're making breakfast now!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.680
I'm gonna be up half the
night repairing the ship.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.270
That's all you get!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.690
Just bread?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.860
Keithron!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:57.480
Haro?

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.070
We said that's all you get!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.740
Lame.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:17.210
So... Why'd you cover for me?

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.340
Because you don't
look like a bad guy.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.050
I'm good at judging people

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.340
Here.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.840
Thank you.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.720
I came here
to steal the Zeta.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.140
But you saved the
Argama, didn't you?

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.140
I wasn't trying to.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.770
The guy who attacked us
looked like an ex-Titan.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.850
Oh. You mean that
army of jerks?

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:38.150
Yeah.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.860
My name's Judau Ashta.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:40.860
I'm Shinta.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.240
And I'm Qum.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.490
Hey! It's a pleasure!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.370
You're the kid from before!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.160
Uh-oh.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.120
Wait!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.120
- Hey! What are you...?!
- Don't!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.120
What are you doing?! Lemme go!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.580
- No, Astonaige!
- Astonaige, don't!

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.430
I've caught up with them.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:14.140
An enemy mobile suit inside
the colony?! What model?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.940
No matching data, sir!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.530
It isn't attacking?
Rear camera!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.450
Crew of the Argama,
I am Mashymre Cello of Axis.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.330
I request your
unconditional surrender.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:40.290
Accept this gracefully, and I will
guarantee the lives of all your crew.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.250
Where's Fa?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.960
En route to the Methuss!

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.840
There's no point trying
to buy yourselves time.

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.340
Do you want me
to smash your bridge?!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.760
Where's that kid?!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.850
Captain, is this
really the time for that?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.510
He's on the bridge!

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.390
Judau!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.730
This guy's pretty cocky if he's trying
to take a ship without damaging it.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:58.850
There we go!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.940
I'm not a man given
to joking around!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.650
I'm serious, too!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:10.450
I swear I'll smash you!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.320
Judau!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Okay! Now watch this!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.170
Enough waiting! Now you die!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.670
What?!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.950
Why, you cowardly...!
Unforgivable!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.750
Fa! Is the Methuss usable?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:02.880
It's fine!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.960
We're inside a colony!
Don't use your rifles!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.380
Roger!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.260
Don't damage the colony!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.760
Roger!
Here he comes!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:21.520
It transformed?
Why, you tricky little...!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.440
This way!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.070
The Methuss really isn't
working that well.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.730
We're short on mechanics.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:34.070
Was it this one? Or this?
Aw, man, I can't remember!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.580
Who's piloting the Zeta?!
We're still fixing it!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.250
Let Judau do it!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.210
Judau?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.840
You can't do it!
Get out of there!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.260
Gimme a break!
I'm a beginner!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.920
Which is why you have to stop!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.840
That girl Fa is
out there, all alone!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:56.430
She's gonna get shot down!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.350
Okay! Okay!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.520
I'll tell you what to do.
Just stop flailing around!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.350
What? That boy's going out?

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.480
All right. That kid, huh?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.440
You're the kid who
tried to steal it today, right?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.950
Don't call me kid!
My name's Judau Ashta!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.950
Can you pilot the Zeta Gundam?

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.280
I'd better, or else I won't
be able to save Fa, right?!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.620
You sure about this?

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.790
Now that you ask again, I'm not sure...
But I'll give it a try!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.250
Whoa!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.470
Number 3?!
The vernier isn't working!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.060
Zeta...!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.560
You like picking on girls?!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.070
"Picking on"?!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.610
To live, a lion will use all his
strength to bring down a rabbit!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.660
By this rose, I so swear!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.490
Hold that thought.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.490
I have a duty in answer to its scent.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:02.540
The Zeta!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.330
Judau, you did it!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.460
You're... Judau?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.540
You just have to cover the Argama!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.460
Thank you!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.960
Big Brother!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.130
Get back!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.760
Get out of the Zeta!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.170
Be careful, all of you!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.340
Where'd he go?

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:19.970
Was that the famous
Zeta Gundam?!

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.520
Sorry for the delay.
I'm still getting used to this.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.350
My name is Mashymre Cello.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.400
I am the commander
of the Axis cruiser Endra.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.860
I'm Judau Ashta.
And I'm...cutting class.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.570
Draw your saber, Judau!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.870
Which switch is it?
This one?

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:50.420
I see. You don't wish to
use weapons. As you like!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.090
Here I come!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:17:59.840
What?!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:00.930
Wrong one!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.390
I do you honor,
and you repay me by running?!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.830
Legs! Legs!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.710
It stopped! He's here!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.340
Is that child one of
the species they call Newtypes?

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.100
He's gonna fight me here?!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.390
A trifle!
Well then, how's this?!

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.400
Not even close!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.360
No fair!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.870
Prepare to die!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.250
Transforming won't
do you any good!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.130
Don't move around!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.050
We're not trying to!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.590
Aren't we kinda high up?

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:30.060
He took a fighting stance
immediately upon landing.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.390
He's used to combat.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.770
It's hard to operate this
thing when there's gravity.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.780
Big Brother, if you're going to save
the Argama, you have to fight for real!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:44.320
What do you think I'm doing?!
Quit distracting me!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.080
We finish this here!
Zeta! Draw your beam saber!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:54.750
How?

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.750
I said draw it!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.040
All right, already!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.840
Should've asked how to use
the beam saber... Here he comes!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.850
What are you doing,
you brute?!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.350
- What's the problem!
- I won't allow this!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.620
- I have you!
- No way!

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.040
What?!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.470
This is... the Zeta?!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.140
I am disgraced.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.650
You did it!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.150
Big Brother!
You actually did it?!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.530
She doesn't sound like
she trusts my talents.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.870
Some little sister!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.330
That kid...

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.670
Well done, Judau.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.050
It was a fluke.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.550
Why didn't you just take off with
the Zeta Gundam afterwards?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.220
I only flew it today
to beat that new suit.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.010
But that won't happen next time.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:32.930
You still intend to steal it?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.230
Maybe.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:38.230
Watch your step, pops. I don't think
that enemy's going to give up so easily.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.520
Understood.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.070
See you around!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:00.170
Now hit the opposite wall, too.
That should hide us completely.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:00.710
Aye, sir!

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.430
So, that's where they're hiding.
Okay then, see you tomorrow.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.720
You're going to do
it again, Big Brother?

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:13.930
That's the plan.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:18.270
Big Brother, I think you did
the right thing today, but...

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:19.350
Hey!

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:20.650
Get in!

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:25.440
If you think you can get on
my good side, forget it!

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.670 --> 00:23:50.470
It looks like something
happened between...

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:53.350
Mashymre and Fa at the local hospital,
but that's beside the point.

00:23:53.350 --> 00:23:55.640
Mashymre is dead
serious about this.

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:58.930
If we don't stop his Galluss,
we can't get close to the Argama.

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:02.860
Hanging on to a mobile suit
barehanded isn't as easy as it looks!

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:04.360
It wears you out!

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:07.860
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Hot-Blooded Mashymre."

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:09.740
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:10.400
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.770 --> 00:24:12.900
HOT-BLOODED MASHYMRE

00:24:09.770 --> 00:24:12.900
Next Time
